{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会inポートメッセ名古屋。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後Pのアナウンス体験！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/05/22/6252679/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第○レーン○○、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待機列が短くなっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手券をお持ちの方は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お早めにレーンにお並びください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"など普段スタッフさんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やって下さっていることを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後Pが第5部の方でやらせて頂きました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初はカミカミで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「P頑張れー！」とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「もっと大きな声でー！」とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「カミカミだよー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"など応援やアドバイスをもらって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/05/22/6252679/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中から、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「うまくなってきたよー」とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「きょうはアナウンスなんだ！」とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「いい感じだよ！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかに変わって！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その皆さんの反応が楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"慣れてきたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「急いでねっ(´>ω∂`)☆」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言っちゃいました！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後Pでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会楽しんでてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手券持ってる人は急いでね！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と挨拶したら皆さんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きな拍手してくれて嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"流石！乃木坂のファンの方は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたたかいなと思いました✧。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪の為、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声が聞き取りづらかったのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"申し訳ないですm(__)m！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーからも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後Pのアナウンス聞こえたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われました\\( ˆ ˆ )/♡嬉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/05/22/6252679/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました(^_−)−☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後P活動、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他に何かできないかな～？！？！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今後もやって行くので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひぜひ注目してくださいね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/